 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y72K6jIwGCIQ7kNvwGsNYM2&_nc_oc=AdqSh2c-yfeGmGHUjRisCFOZ1aG_WhDoSMoEl52F39d8kevEeEFcRVkjjKdmAR9QJ78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG4D-n1D8d-H8CwbAyGDOJTohP-1fcTWA76B4cVhWQ_Pg&oe=6A883401"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c71qgxvezlkQ7kNvwFKiXX6&_nc_oc=AdoHLnitUV5LwH8gmSUez8HyUcWv8iuIoNpoS4iVzLYvqvrpwOYub7d_3YMwUTGsIjo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFElx6fPa4YMEEgAWiFyX4PNheay6Eziu8Okolmxab9ag&oe=6A884166"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1UV33x1SytsQ7kNvwGGoljp&_nc_oc=AdrLakqYU7kwr2RZCDM7uqngs9rcCxqVmk4rdkTg8ulxubRp1fEzL6ghX4vmuxmROD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFjn3Ao2d2Z4JlAC_YcilRB4h_UG3HjsC4p1T1NUS0zrw&oe=6A884B5C"}, {"fil